# --- Dataset cache -----------------------------------------------------
# The raw DOHA Parquet shards live in the sibling `doha` repo clone
# (../doha/doha_parsed_cases/*.parquet) and are NOT duplicated here.
# `src/data_loader.py` builds a local merged cache under data/processed/
# on first run; every teammate builds/keeps their own copy, so it must
# stay out of git (it's ~150-200MB, well over reasonable repo size).
data/raw/
data/processed/
